{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33006","headline":"贵宅 · 曹邺","name":"贵宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入门又到门，到门戟相对。\n玉箫声尚远，疑似人不在。\n公子厌花繁，买药栽庭内。\n望远不上楼，牕中见天外。\n此地日烹羊，无异我食菜。\n自是愁人眼，见之若奢泰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}